ClauPet character artwork / ClauPet 角色图片
================================================================================

Scope / 适用范围
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
All image files in this directory (assets/pet/), including the files in its
subdirectories (earlier design versions).

本目录（assets/pet/）下的所有图片，包括子目录中的早期设计版本。


