Attribution / 署名
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Original character design / 原作角色设计:
  Title / 作品名: 《Claude 拟人立绘·橘白礼服ver》
  Author / 作者:  ZipZipPipe
  Source / 来源:  https://蓝色大肥鱼.com/works/claude202610030001.html
                  (https://xn--pssy23gqgbz2d718b.com/works/claude202610030001.html)
  License / 许可: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (confirmed by the author / 经作者确认)

Changes / 修改说明:
  The chibi (two-heads-tall) desktop-pet images in this directory were created
  by whywhy1352 with AI image generation tools, using the original design above
  as a reference, in five expressions/poses (idle, working, waiting, error,
  and being lifted while dragged).
  They are derivative works and are released under the same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
  license, with the author's permission.

  本目录中的 Q 版（两头身）桌宠图片，由 whywhy1352 以上述原作为参考、借助 AI 绘图工具
  创作，共五种表情/姿势（空闲、工作中、等待、出错、被拖动时被拎起来）。它们属于衍生作品，经原作者同意，
  以相同的 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 协议发布。

Suggested attribution when reusing / 转载或使用时的建议署名:
  "ClauPet character art by whywhy1352, based on a character design by
   ZipZipPipe, licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."
  「ClauPet 角色图片：whywhy1352，基于 ZipZipPipe 的角色设计，采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 许可。」


